{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/69a98f72cfd3800c9aaacc7f4dec5d81.poster.avif?t=1765356436\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/69a98f72cfd3800c9aaacc7f4dec5d81.webm?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/69a98f72cfd3800c9aaacc7f4dec5d81.mp4?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SURVIVE IN TINY LANDS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miniature Legends is a small-scale survival roguelike where tiny heroes travel across planets overtaken by mysterious forces. Battle endless waves of creatures, collect powerful abilities, unlock new legends, and grow insanely strong in this fast-paced roguelike board-battler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/07a0f0f281050bf3eb5c40a8c644be3f.poster.avif?t=1765356436\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/07a0f0f281050bf3eb5c40a8c644be3f.webm?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/07a0f0f281050bf3eb5c40a8c644be3f.mp4?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SMALL ARENAS? OUTPLAY THEM</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run drops you into a <strong>tight, board-like arena</strong> where every tile matters. Dodge, reposition, and outplay swarms of enemies\u00a0as mobility becomes your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/a6669bdb180f3309ae0f1e87ec20ef6a.poster.avif?t=1765356436\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/a6669bdb180f3309ae0f1e87ec20ef6a.webm?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/a6669bdb180f3309ae0f1e87ec20ef6a.mp4?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ALONE OR UP TO 4 PLAYERS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the planets alone or gather a team of up to four legends. Stand together, combine your power, and push back against endless cosmic threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miniature Legends mixes cozy survivors gameplay with lovable co-op chaos. Fight silly creatures, upgrade powerful abilities together, and try not to get wiped out as a team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/546b3015684e2ff05dc2ceb5f3666450.poster.avif?t=1765356436\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/546b3015684e2ff05dc2ceb5f3666450.webm?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/546b3015684e2ff05dc2ceb5f3666450.mp4?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019ve got bugs to report, feedback to share, or just want to chat with the team and other tiny legends, our Discord is the place to be! Come be part of the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/23ad29df64a28042958bc285089485c6.poster.avif?t=1765356436\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/23ad29df64a28042958bc285089485c6.webm?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/23ad29df64a28042958bc285089485c6.mp4?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/cd92b0e4842f83f694ce63893da05ce9.avif?t=1765356436\" width=526 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Roguelike Board-Battler</strong> \u2013 Fight in tight, board-like arenas where every tile and movement matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Endless Waves of Enemies</strong> \u2013 Survive increasingly intense waves of creatures with unique patterns and attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Collect Crazy Abilities</strong> \u2013 Stack upgrades and abilities to create broken builds and absurd damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Unlockable Characters</strong> \u2013 Discover new legends with different starting kits and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Online Co-Op (up to 4 players)</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends across platforms and fuse your builds into ridiculous synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Multiple Input Options</strong> \u2013 Play comfortably with mouse &amp; keyboard, controller, or touch input.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>High Replayability</strong> \u2013 Randomized waves, upgrades, and builds keep each run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Tiny Worlds, Big Chaos</strong> \u2013 Cute scale, chunky visuals, and over-the-top combat.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824640?t=1765356436","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/ad7675837f6cab1890e6f7b4cde3b7a51e50de64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765356436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/fe5d2b5383476c34e4e88af5969710387434636d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765356436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/fe5d2b5383476c34e4e88af5969710387434636d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765356436","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/69a98f72cfd3800c9aaacc7f4dec5d81.poster.avif?t=1765356436\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/69a98f72cfd3800c9aaacc7f4dec5d81.webm?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/69a98f72cfd3800c9aaacc7f4dec5d81.mp4?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>SURVIVE IN TINY LANDS</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miniature Legends is a small-scale survival roguelike where tiny heroes travel across planets overtaken by mysterious forces. Battle endless waves of creatures, collect powerful abilities, unlock new legends, and grow insanely strong in this fast-paced roguelike board-battler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/07a0f0f281050bf3eb5c40a8c644be3f.poster.avif?t=1765356436\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/07a0f0f281050bf3eb5c40a8c644be3f.webm?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/07a0f0f281050bf3eb5c40a8c644be3f.mp4?t=1765356436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>SMALL ARENAS? OUTPLAY THEM</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run drops you into a <strong>tight, board-like arena</strong> where every tile matters. Dodge, reposition, and outplay swarms of enemies\u00a0as mobility becomes your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/a6669bdb180f3309ae0f1e87ec20ef6a.poster.avif?t=1765356436\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824640/extras/a6669bdb180f3309ae0f1e87ec20ef6a.webm